; showcase — written by the in-game editor (dynamic layer).

; A lever on the west wall of the entry hall. It opens the wooden door down the
; entry corridor, which is also the demo of a button driving a door.
button lever 10 3 west target=door_wood

; One door per MOTION, so all three can be judged in one walk. The entry
; corridor (x=13) runs north-south with rock both sides, so every cell in it is
; a doorway; z=16/18/20 hold the framed-arch props, leaving 17 and 19 free.
; The stone slab sits in the side-room passage instead, which runs east-west —
; the other doorway axis, and worth proving.
door wooden_door 13 19 north name=door_wood
door portcullis 13 17 north name=door_gate
door stone_door 18 8 east name=door_slab
